  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Thinly slice leek.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-668df38cc2d484eb98289ef4-fea4fe2a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with water. Add a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil over high heat.\n• Cook risoni in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 7-8 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people), then drain and return risoni to the saucepan with a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-668df38cc2d484eb98289ef4-46e9249c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While risoni is cooking, heat a large frying pan over high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook sliced mushrooms, leek and zucchini, stirring, until browned and softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic, herb & mushroom seasoning and the butter and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Reduce heat to low, add vegetable stock powder, light cooking cream, baby spinach leaves, reserved pasta water and cooked risoni. Simmer, until slightly thickened, 1-2 minute. Remove from heat and season with pepper to taste. TIP: Add an extra splash of water if the mixture looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-668df38cc2d484eb98289ef4-90fd0d0c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy mushroom and zucchini risoni between bowls.\n• Top with Parmesan cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-668df38cc2d484eb98289ef4-c8a14f93.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
